WEBVTT

00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:29.193
(LAUGHING)

00:00:39.673 --> 00:00:41.993
(HORNS BLOWING)

00:01:14.953 --> 00:01:17.873
To the glistening Eastern Sea,
闪耀的东方海洋

00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:21.633
I give you Queen Lucy, the Valiant.
我赐予你露西女王 英勇非凡

00:01:47.193 --> 00:01:49.353
To the great Western Wood,
伟大的西方森林

00:01:49.753 --> 00:01:53.033
King Edmund, the Just.
爱德蒙国王 公正无私

00:01:55.193 --> 00:01:57.393
To the radiant Southern Sun,
灿烂的南方太阳

00:01:59.393 --> 00:02:02.193
Queen Susan, the Gentle.
苏珊女王 温柔和善

00:02:03.913 --> 00:02:06.993
And to the clear Northern Sky,
晴朗的北方天空

00:02:07.433 --> 00:02:09.713
I give you King Peter,
我赐予你彼得国王

00:02:10.953 --> 00:02:12.633
the Magnificent.
至尊崇高

00:02:16.993 --> 00:02:19.673
Once a King or Queen of Narnia,
在纳尼亚 一朝为王

00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:22.033
always a King or Queen.
终身为王

00:02:23.113 --> 00:02:24.473
May your wisdom grace us
愿你们的智慧给我们带来荣耀

00:02:24.633 --> 00:02:27.633
until the stars rain down
from the heavens.
直到天上的繁星坠落

00:02:28.433 --> 00:02:30.673
ALL: Long live King Peter!
彼得国王万岁

00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:32.233
Long live King Edmund!
爱德蒙国王万岁

00:02:32.393 --> 00:02:33.393
(LAUGHING)
爱德蒙国王万岁

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:35.753
Long live Queen Susan!
苏珊女王万岁

00:02:35.913 --> 00:02:38.913
Long live Queen Lucy!
露西女王万岁

00:02:39.313 --> 00:02:41.233
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:03.553 --> 00:03:05.073
TUMNUS: Don't worry.
别担心

00:03:07.393 --> 00:03:08.993
We'll see him again.
我们还会再见到他的

00:03:09.153 --> 00:03:11.233
-When?
-In time.
什么时候？
总有一天

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:17.153
One day he'll be here
and the next he won't.
有时他会出现 有时又会离去

00:03:19.393 --> 00:03:21.633
But you mustn't press him.
但你不能勉强他

00:03:22.193 --> 00:03:24.753
After all, he's not a tame lion.
要知道 他不是驯化了的狮子

00:03:25.953 --> 00:03:27.073
No.
对

00:03:28.593 --> 00:03:30.193
But he is good.
可他是好狮子

00:03:30.873 --> 00:03:32.193
Here.
给

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:36.153
You need it more than I do.
你比我更需要它

00:04:10.673 --> 00:04:12.313
(NEIGHING)

00:04:24.553 --> 00:04:26.033
(CHUCKLING)

00:04:29.513 --> 00:04:30.913
(PANTING)

00:04:32.193 --> 00:04:34.193
Are you all right, Philip?
你还好吧 菲利普？

00:04:34.353 --> 00:04:36.593
I'm not as young as I once was.
我已经不像以前那么年轻了

00:04:36.833 --> 00:04:38.633
(NEIGHING)

00:04:39.233 --> 00:04:40.713
Come on, Ed.
快点 爱德

00:04:41.673 --> 00:04:44.353
-Just catching my breath.
-Well, that's all we'll catch at this rate.
让我喘口气
照这个样子我们什么都抓不到

00:04:44.553 --> 00:04:46.953
-What did he say again, Susan?
-"You girls wait in the castle.
他刚才怎么说的来着 苏珊？
「在城堡里等着

00:04:47.113 --> 00:04:48.953
I'll get the stag myself."
我自己去抓白鹿」

00:04:49.113 --> 00:04:50.473
(LAUGHING)

00:04:54.593 --> 00:04:56.033
What's this?
这是什么？

00:05:01.913 --> 00:05:03.713
It seems familiar.
看上去很眼熟

00:05:06.753 --> 00:05:08.593
As if from a dream.
好像来自梦里

00:05:08.753 --> 00:05:10.633
Or a dream of a dream.
或者是个梦中梦

00:05:14.073 --> 00:05:15.713
Spare Oom.
空皇疆

00:05:19.233 --> 00:05:20.993
-Lucy!
-Not again.
露西
又来了

00:05:23.393 --> 00:05:25.153
-PETER: Lu?
-Come on!
露？
快来

00:05:37.073 --> 00:05:39.073
These aren't branches.
这些不是树枝

00:05:40.953 --> 00:05:44.153
-They're coats.
-Susan, you're on my foot!
是大衣
苏珊 你踩着我的脚了

00:05:44.313 --> 00:05:46.273
Peter, move off!
彼得 快走啊

00:05:46.433 --> 00:05:48.153
EDMUND: Stop shoving.
PETER: Stop it!
别推我
别乱动

00:05:48.313 --> 00:05:50.113
SUSAN: I'm not on your toe!
我没踩你的脚趾头

00:05:50.633 --> 00:05:52.753
(ALL GRUNTING)

00:06:08.513 --> 00:06:10.113
There you are.
你们在这儿呢

00:06:12.473 --> 00:06:15.233
What were you all
doing in the wardrobe?
你们几个在衣橱里干什么？

00:06:16.953 --> 00:06:19.993
You wouldn't believe us
if we told you, sir.
就算我们说出来
你也不会相信的 先生

00:06:25.713 --> 00:06:26.993
Try me.
试试看吧

00:06:38.073 --> 00:06:40.113
(CAN'T TAKE IT IN PLAYING)

